					{Name: "zeta", Base: "main"},
					{Name: "alpha", Base: "main"},
				}}); err != nil {
					t.Fatal(err)
				}
				for _, name := range []string{"zeta", "alpha"} {
					if err := os.MkdirAll(filepath.Join(featurePath, "worktrees", name), 0755); err != nil {
						t.Fatal(err)
					}
				}
			},
			wantErr: `worktree "alpha"`,
		},
